                                "sense_id": "419592c7-ba90-39d4-a41a-4e24bb9182b6",
                                "text": "Phil and his counterparts in Asia and the US are deployed to infiltrate pirate groups; to study IRC; to get under the skin of the lamers, the dabblers, and the professionals; to chat, seduce, charm, and interact with the denizens of this bizarre over-underworld."
